WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.215
Thank you so much.

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:09.175
Yeah, it's a really big honor.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:09.759
This is an honor.

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.428
I didn't get a chance
to thank my family,

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.346
so I just want to thank 
my wife, Fatima, my mom,

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.973
dad, brother, sister,
all my family.

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:16.099
I love you.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:18.601
Yeah. Thank you
my family as well for

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:22.147
having more faith in me at times
than I did/do in myself.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:23.773
How's it feel, Aneil?

00:00:23.773 --> 00:00:27.777
Yeah, it's surreal and nice.

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:30.155
Feels nice.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.990
No, that is nice.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:32.782
It's amazing.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:35.118
Nice is underrated.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:37.037
You know, people think
“Oh, well don't say nice.”

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.121
This feels nice.

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:38.955
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.331
That's how I describe it.

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:42.876
Nice is not six out of ten.
Nice is just really-

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:43.376
Yeah, man.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.335
It’s nice.

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:45.045
Like a nine.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.212
 A nine out of nice.

